{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":75,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܐܲܠܬܲܫܚܸܬ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܐܣܦ. ܙܡܪܬ‌ܐ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܫܲܟܘܼܪܹܐ ܝܘܲܚ ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܟܘܼܪܹܐ ܝܘܲܚ ܘܩܘܼܪܒܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܫܸܡܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܘܼܡܵܪ̈ܘܼܟ݂ ܗܘܼܩܹܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܐܵܗܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܕܪܵܫܡܹܢ ܥܕܵܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܬܪܘܼܨܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܒܸܬ ܕܵܝܢܹܢ ܐܵܢܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܦܫܝܼܪܹܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܘܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܥܵܡܪ̈ܵܢܘܼܗ̇،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܢܵܐ ܡܘܼܩܘܹܐ ܠܝܼ ܣܛܘܼܢܘܼ̈ܗ̇. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܐܡܝܼܪܝܼ ܠܚܵܬܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ: ’ܠܵܐ ܚܵܬܪܝܼܬܘܿܢ،‘","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ: ’ܠܵܐ ܡܲܪܡܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܪܹܝܫܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"’ܠܵܐ ܡܲܪܡܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܠܡܪܵܘܡܵܐ ܪܹܝܫܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܦܠܵܐ ܗܲܡܙܸܡܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܒܩܕܵܠܵܐ ܪܵܡܵܐ.‘“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܠܵܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܡܲܕܢܚܵܐ ܘܠܵܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܡܲܥܪܒ݂ܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܵܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܒܲܪܝܼܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܐܵܬܝܵܐ ܪܵܡܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܸܠܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܕܲܝܵܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܐܵܗܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܡܲܟܸܦ ܘܠܐܵܗܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܡܲܪܸܡ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܟܵܣܵܐ ܒܐܝܼܕܵܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܚܲܡܪܵܐ ܡܸܛܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܸܠܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܡܙܵܓ݂ܵܐ ܘܡܸܢܹܗ ܟܹܐ ܕܵܪܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܪܝܼܪܵܐܝܼܬ، ܒܸܬ ܫܵܬ‌ܝܼ ܡܸܢܹܗ، ܘܕܘܼܪܕܹܗ ܒܸܬ ܠܵܡܨܝܼ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܵܢܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܕܥܸܢ ܐܵܗܵܐ ܠܥܵܠܲܡ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܙܵܡܪܹܢ ܠܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܝܲܥܩܘܿܒ݂، ܕܐܵܡܹܪ:","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܒܸܬ ܫܵܡܛܹܢ ܟܠܹܗ ܚܲܝܠܵܐ ܕܪ̈ܲܫܝܼܥܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܦܵܝܫܝܼ ܡܘܼܪܡܹܐ ܪܹ̈ܝܫܹܐ ܕܙܲܕܝܼܩܹ̈ܐ.“","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/75.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/76.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/74.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}